{
 "brief": "The Hind Rajab Foundation, a Belgium-based human rights organization, filed an official complaint with Vietnamese authorities against an Israeli reserve soldier currently in the country, Shehab Wire reported. The foundation accused the soldier of participating in war crimes and genocide against Palestinians in Gaza and Lebanon.\n\nThe move represents an attempt to pursue legal accountability through third-country jurisdictions for alleged violations during Israel's military operations. The complaint was submitted to Vietnamese authorities, placing the burden on the Southeast Asian nation to investigate the allegations and potentially act on charges related to conduct in the Palestinian territories and neighboring Lebanon.",
